{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_01",
      "hash": "61867d565a832009",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "A Pokémon is sprawled out in\\na deep and comfortable slumber."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_02",
      "hash": "61867a565a831af0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Do you want to use the Poké Flute?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_03",
      "hash": "61867b565a831ca3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You played the Poké Flute."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_04",
      "hash": "618680565a832522",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Snorlax woke up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_07",
      "hash": "61867f565a83236f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Snorlax is looking at you...\\nAnd it looks hungry!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_01",
      "hash": "dd4ceab8a4c8f45a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "???: Hey, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_02",
      "hash": "dd4ce9b8a4c8f2a7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MR. FUJI: There’s something I forgot to mention\\nwhen I gave you the Poké Flute..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_03",
      "hash": "dd4ce8b8a4c8f0f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Oh! Perfect timing!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_05",
      "hash": "dd4ce6b8a4c8ed8e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You see, this Pokémon is called Snorlax.\\c\\nIt’s been known to attack the first thing it sees\\nafter waking up. It thinks what it sees is food!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_06",
      "hash": "dd4ce5b8a4c8ebdb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Since it can be pretty dangerous, please help\\nit calm down by battling it with your Pokémon."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_07",
      "hash": "dd4ce4b8a4c8ea28",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Once you defeat it, it’ll become more docile.\\nYou should be able to catch it, just like\\r\\nany other Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_06",
      "hash": "61867e565a8321bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Snorlax mistook you for food and attacked!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub020_sys_05",
      "hash": "618681565a8326d5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Snorlax calmed down.\\nIt gave a huge yawn...\\r\\nand returned to the mountains."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_08",
      "hash": "dd4ce3b8a4c8e875",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MR. FUJI: Oh my, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]!\\nThat was impressive!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_09",
      "hash": "dd4ce2b8a4c8e6c2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "MR. FUJI: Oh, too bad, [VAR TRNAME(0000)]..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_10",
      "hash": "dd4965b8a4c5dc84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "There are other Pokémon out there that will\\ntry to attack Trainers, just as Snorlax did.\\c\\nWhen facing such a Pokémon, the best thing to\\ndo is to defeat it, then catch it.\\c\\nRemember—defeat, then catch. In that order!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub020_fuji_11",
      "hash": "dd4966b8a4c5de37",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Well, I’ll see you later, then!"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_020_max",
      "hash": "af6dc9a4f7b39c54"
    }
  ]
}
